@startuml
title Submit a template from the public web form
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontColor black
}

participant "Author" as U
participant "Web App" as W
participant "Express API" as A
participant "Validation" as V
participant "Supabase" as S

U -> W: Fill /submit form + upload preview/sample
W -> A: POST /api/submissions (multipart)
A -> V: validateSubmission(body)
V --> A: normalized payload
A -> S: resolve category and publisher slugs
S --> A: taxonomy IDs
A -> S: submissions.insert(status = pending)
S --> A: created submission
A --> W: 201 receipt
W --> U: Show pending confirmation
note over A: Submission rate limit is 5 requests/minute per client.
@enduml
